<react-app
  app-name="issues-react"
  initial-path="/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9953"
    style="display: block; min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);"
  data-attempted-ssr="true"
  data-ssr="true"
  data-lazy="false"
  data-alternate="false"
  data-data-router-enabled="false"
  data-react-profiling="false"
>
  
  <script type="application/json" data-target="react-app.embeddedData">{"payload":{"preloaded_records":{},"structured_data":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","headline":" v8.0.0 Migration Guide ","articleBody":"Previous migration guide: [v7.0.0 Migration Guide](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/8447).\n\n## .NET 7 is no longer supported\nFor .NET 7 support, stay on the latest v7.x.x version. For bug fixes in v7, please PR and we'll release updates.\n\nMore details: [#9511](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9511)\n\n## Dialog\n\u003e [!CAUTION]\n\u003e Change `MudDialogInstance` to `IMudDialogInstance`.\n\n`DialogOptions` is now an immutable record. Use `SetOptionsAsync` and `with` to modify `DialogOptions`:\n\n```csharp\n[CascadingParameter]\nprivate IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; }\n\nprivate Task ToggleFullscreenAsync()\n{\n    var options = MudDialog.Options with\n    {\n        FullScreen = !(MudDialog.Options.FullScreen ?? false)\n    };\n\n    return MudDialog.SetOptionsAsync(options);\n}\n```\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10066\n\n## KeyInterceptor\n`IKeyInterceptor` / `KeyInterceptor`, `IKeyInterceptorFactory` / `KeyInterceptorFactory` were removed and replaced with `KeyInterceptorService`. More details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9896\n\n`KeyOptions` is now immutable. More details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9969\n\n## MudPopoverService\nRemoved from the core, replaced by `PopoverService`. The `MudPopoverService` was legacy, provided only for cases where you might encounter issues with `PopoverService`. If you encounter issues, please submit an issue.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9957\n\n## DialogService\n- Removed `OnDialogInstanceAdded`, use `DialogInstanceAddedAsync` instead. [#9980](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9980)\n\n## Converters\nIn **Converter.cs**, several property signatures have been updated to enhance localization support. These properties no longer return English messages directly. Instead, they now return keys intended for localization, accompanied by additional parameters:\n\n- **OnError**: Updated from `Action\u003cstring\u003e?` to `Action\u003cstring, object[]\u003e?`. This allows passing a key and optional parameters, enabling more flexible and accurate localization.\n- **SetErrorMessage** and **GetErrorMessage**: Both changed from `string?` to `(string, object[])?`. These properties now provide a key for localization along with relevant parameters, shifting message formatting to the localization system.\n\n## EventUtil\nThe following API has been removed:\n```csharp\nEventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\n```\nIt has been replaced with:\n```csharp\nthis.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\n```\nBecause this is now an extension method that requires a reference to `ComponentBase`. The previous `EventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler` did not propagate exceptions to `ErrorBoundary` (see https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/54543). The new method ensures that exceptions are properly handled and propagated.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9967\n\n## Charts\n- `TimeSeriesDiplayType` was renamed to `TimeSeriesDisplayType`.\n- `EndSlopeSpline`, `ILineInterpolator`, `Matrix`, `MatrixSolver`, `NaturalSpline`, `PeriodicSpline`, `SplineInterpolator`, `SvgCircle`, `SvgPath`, `SvgText` are now internal.\n- `TimeSeriesChartSeries`, `TimeSeriesDisplayType` moved to `MudBlazor` namespace for consistency.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9919\n\n## DataGrid\n**CellActions**:\nThe following properties are now \"required\":\n- SetSelectedItemAsync\n- StartEditingItemAsync\n- CancelEditingItemAsync\n- ToggleHierarchyVisibilityForItemAsync\n\n**Column**:\n- Removed `Action ColumnStateHasChanged`\n\n**MudDataGrid**:\n- `_classname` renamed to `Classname`\n- `_style` renamed to `Stylename`\n- `_tableStyle` renamed to `TableStyle`\n- `_tableClass` renamed to `TableClass`\n- `_headClassname` renamed to `HeadClassname`\n- `_footClassname` renamed to `FootClassname`\n- `_headerFooterStyle` renamed to `HeaderFooterStyle`\n- Removed `CancelledEditingItem`, replace with `CanceledEditingItem`. [#9982](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9982)\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10149\n\n## MudTheme\n- `BaseTypography` is now an **abstract** class! If you used `new BaseTypography()` please replace it with corresponding implementation. [#9434](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434)\n- Class `Default` was renamed to `DefaultTypography` to a allow source generation STJ usage. [#9434](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434)\n- Class `H1` was renamed to `H1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H2` was renamed to `H2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H3` was renamed to `H3Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H4` was renamed to `H4Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H5` was renamed to `H5Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H6` was renamed to `H6Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Subtitle1` was renamed to `Subtitle1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Subtitle2` was renamed to `Subtitle2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Body1` was renamed to `Body1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Body2` was renamed to `Body2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Input` and the property was removed, use subtitle1. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Class `Button` was renamed to `ButtonTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Caption` was renamed to `CaptionTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Overline` was renamed to `OverlineTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- In `Typography` the `FontWeight` and `LineHeight` are now an `string` type instead of `int`. [#9011](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9011)\n\n## DropZone\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionOrignZoneIdentiifer`, replace with `GetTransactionOriginZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionOrignZoneIdentifier`, replace with `GetTransactionOriginZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionCurrentZoneIdentiifer`, replace with `GetTransactionCurrentZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `IsOrign`, replace with `IsOrigin`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n\n## Inputs\n- `Typo.input` was removed. Use `Typo.subtitle1` instead. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Accordingly all `input` typo CSS was removed. Use `--mud-typography-subtitle1` instead. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Note: This changes the order of the `Typo` enum to where it was before v7. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- `MudInputAdornment.Edge` was replaced with `MudInputAdornment.Placement`. [#10057](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10057)\n- Popover menus now originate from under the field by default. [#10071](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10071)\n\n## Autocomplete\n- No longer wraps around to the top item when using arrow keys in order to align with similar components. [#10161](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10161)\n- The public `ScrollToListItemAsync` method was removed. [#10161](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10161)\n- When `Immediate` is enabled, the value is now coerced immediately. [#10138](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10138)\n\n## MudColor\n- Renamed `HslChanged` to `HslEquals`, and the result is now not reverted. [#10355](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10355)\n- `Equals` now checks both `RGBA` and `HSL` values. Previously, it only checked `RGBA`. [#10355](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10355)\n\n## MudMenu\n- Menus can now be directly nested without additional setup. Nested menus inside another MudMenu will now be rendered as a MudMenuItem instead of MudButton. [#10452](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10452), [#10469](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10469)\n- The popover now originates from under the activator by default. [#10071](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10071)\n- `IconSize` was removed in order to align with Material Design. [#10478](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10478) [#10542](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10542)\n\n## MudChip\n\nThe MudChip now renders a semantic anchor tag in place if the div if an href is specified. It can now be a true anchor and so no longer acts like a button. The browser now handles the click (and Enter key) so OnClick is disabled and the close button is no longer shown (if applicable). This improves accessibility, including allowing the user to hover it to see the link it will direct them to, middle click to open in a new tab, or drag to another place.\n\n## Localization\nIn `DefaultLocalizationInterceptor` we removed:\n```C#\nLocalizedString TranslationFallback(string key)\n```\nuse instead:\n```C#\nLocalizedString TranslationWithFallback(string key, params object[] arguments)\n```\n\n**Note:** Legacy keys were removed:\n| Old Key                        | New Key                           |\n|--------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| MudDataGrid.=                  | MudDataGrid_EqualSign             |\n| MudDataGrid.!=                 | MudDataGrid_NotEqualSign          |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003e                  | MudDataGrid_GreaterThanSign       |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003e=                 | MudDataGrid_GreaterThanOrEqualSign|\n| MudDataGrid.\u003c                  | MudDataGrid_LessThanSign          |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003c=                 | MudDataGrid_LessThanOrEqualSign   |\n| MudDataGrid.RefreshData        | MudDataGrid_RefreshData           |\n| MudDataGrid.is not             | MudDataGrid_IsNot                 |\n| MudDataGrid.is not empty       | MudDataGrid_IsNotEmpty            |\n| MudDataGrid.Sort               | MudDataGrid_Sort                  |\n| MudDataGrid.Save               | MudDataGrid_Save                  |\n| MudDataGrid.True               | MudDataGrid_True                  |\n| MudDataGrid.False              | MudDataGrid_False                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Hide               | MudDataGrid_Hide                  |\n| MudDataGrid.HideAll            | MudDataGrid_HideAll               |\n| MudDataGrid.starts with        | MudDataGrid_StartsWith            |\n| MudDataGrid.equals             | MudDataGrid_Equals                |\n| MudDataGrid.not equals         | MudDataGrid_NotEquals             |\n| MudDataGrid.Unsort             | MudDataGrid_Unsort                |\n| MudDataGrid.Columns            | MudDataGrid_Columns               |\n| MudDataGrid.Loading            | MudDataGrid_Loading               |\n| MudDataGrid.MoveUp             | MudDataGrid_MoveUp                |\n| MudDataGrid.MoveDown           | MudDataGrid_MoveDown              |\n| MudDataGrid.is                 | MudDataGrid_Is                    |\n| MudDataGrid.is before          | MudDataGrid_IsBefore              |\n| MudDataGrid.is on or before    | MudDataGrid_IsOnOrBefore          |\n| MudDataGrid.is on or after     | MudDataGrid_IsOnOrAfter           |\n| MudDataGrid.Filter             | MudDataGrid_Filter                |\n| MudDataGrid.contains           | MudDataGrid_Contains              |\n| MudDataGrid.Value              | MudDataGrid_Value                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Group              | MudDataGrid_Group                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Apply              | MudDataGrid_Apply                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Clear              | MudDataGrid_Clear                 |\n| MudDataGrid.ShowAll            | MudDataGrid_ShowAll               |\n| MudDataGrid.Column             | MudDataGrid_Column                |\n| MudDataGrid.Cancel             | MudDataGrid_Cancel                |\n| MudDataGrid.FilterValue        | MudDataGrid_FilterValue           |\n| MudDataGrid.Operator           | MudDataGrid_Operator              |\n| MudDataGrid.is empty           | MudDataGrid_IsEmpty               |\n| MudDataGrid.is after           | MudDataGrid_IsAfter               |\n| MudDataGrid.Ungroup            | MudDataGrid_Ungroup               |\n| MudDataGrid.not contains       | MudDataGrid_NotContains           |\n| MudDataGrid.ends with          | MudDataGrid_EndsWith              |\n| MudDataGrid.CollapseAllGroups  | MudDataGrid_CollapseAllGroups     |\n| MudDataGrid.AddFilter          | MudDataGrid_AddFilter             |\n| MudDataGrid.ExpandAllGroups    | MudDataGrid_ExpandAllGroups       |\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10001\n\n## Other Changes\n- **MudTable**: `EditButtonContext` namespace changed from `MudBlazorFix` to `MudBlazor`. [#9952](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9952)\n- **MudCollapse**: Reworked to use a grid instead of JavaScript for height calculation. Animation is now a static **300 ms**. [#10056](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10056)\n- **MudSelectItem**: `Ripple`, `Href`, `ForceLoad`, and `OnClick` parameters removed. They were never implemented. [#10045](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10045)\n- **MudBaseSelectItem**: Removed base class. Copy-paste its code if you inherited this class. [#10045](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10045)\n- **MudFormComponent**: `Dispose(bool disposing)` replaced with `protected virtual ValueTask DisposeAsyncCore()`. This affects all components inheriting this base class. [#10037](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10037)\n- **ResizeObserver**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IResizeObserver` / `IResizeObserverFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10055](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10055)\n- **EventListener**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IEventListener` / `IEventListenerFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10051](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10051)\n- **JsApiService**: Now internal. Inject `IJsApiService` via DI to use its API. [#9994](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9994)\n- **JsEvent**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IJsEvent` / `IJsEventFactory` via DI to use its API. [#9996](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9996) [#10061](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10061)\n- **ScrollListener**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollListener` / `IScrollListenerFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollSpy**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollSpy` / `IScrollSpyFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollManager**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollManager` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollManagerException**: Removed, not used in the core. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollOptions**: Removed, not used in the core. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- Renamed `IIJSRuntimeExtentions` to `IJSRuntimeExtensions`. [#9997](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9997)\n- Renamed `SortingAssistent` to `SortingAssistant`. [#9952](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9952)\n- Removed `EnableIllegalRazorParameterDetection` from `MudGlobal`. [#9580](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9580)\n- **MudCheckBox**: Renamed `HandleKeyDown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudNumericField**: Renamed `HandleKeydown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`, `HandleKeyUp` to `HandleKeyUpAsync`, `OnMouseWheel` to `OnMouseWheelAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudSwitch**: Renamed `HandleKeyDown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudFileUpload**: Now generates a new `input` with every file change to retain references to previous files. It is no longer possible to supply your own `id` to the underlying `input`. More details: [#9600](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9600)\n- **MudRadio**, **MudCheckBox**, **MudSwitch**: `LabelPosition` and `Placement` replaced by `LabelPlacement` of type `Placement` (enum). `Checked` property replaced by `T Value`. [#9472](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9472)\n- **MudSwitch**: `SwitchLabelClassname` was renamed to `LabelClassName`. [#9472](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9472)\n- **MudDrawer**: The variant `Temporary` / `Persistent` has been changed to behave non-responsively, meaning solely controlled by the `Open` parameter. [#10095](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10095)\n- **MudBreadcrumbs**: BreadcrumbItem is now a record and any class that inherits from it must be updated to a record as well. [#10116](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10116)\n- **MudBreadcrumbs**: The `ul` element is now an `ol` wrapped in a `nav` in order to improve accessibility semantics. [#10115](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10115)\n- **MudToggleItem**: The span containing the checkmark icon was removed and the icon is now a direct child of mud-button-label. Checkmark classes that were on the span have been moved to the icon as well.\n- **MudSelect**: The dropdown is now opened on `pointerdown` instead of `click` to match the behavior of similar components. [#10129](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10129)\n- **MudListItem**: Parameter `Gutters` was made nullable. [#10199](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10199)\n- **MudNumericField**: Changed default `InputMode` to `InputMode.decimal`. [#9923](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9923)\n- **MudPopover**: `RelativeWidth` is now nullable `bool?`. [#10238](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10238)\n- **MudSwipeArea**: Now uses `onpointer*` instead of `ontouch*`. Now supports swipes with mouse as well. [#9445](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9445)\n- **SnackbarOptions**: The delegate invoked on Snackbar click has been renamed from `Onclick` to `OnClick`. [#8589](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/8589)\n- **MudSelect**: Changed the visibility of `_currentIcon` from public to internal. [#10451](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10451)\n- **MudOverlay**: Moved to SectionOutlet with `MudPopoverProvider` in all cases except dialogs, absolute positioned overlays, and overlays with child content. Should have minimal impact unless you have previously used a workaround for overlay positioning. Unit tests now always need a popover provider if they want to interact/check if the mud-overlay exists, \ni.e. `var providerComp = Context.RenderComponent\u003cMudPopoverProvider\u003e();` [#10446](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10446)\n- **MudOverlay**: Now positioned statically and re positioned for nested popovers. to avoid this behavior set `Absolute=\"true\"`. [#10446](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10446)\n- **MudToggleGroup**: Removed `Rounded` in favor of our CSS utility classes, i.e. `rounded-pill`. [#10533](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10533)","author":{"url":"https://github.com/ScarletKuro","@type":"Person","name":"ScarletKuro"},"datePublished":"2024-10-10T15:10:51.000Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"https://schema.org/CommentAction","userInteractionCount":66},"url":"https://github.com/9953/MudBlazor/issues/9953"},"preloadedQueries":[{"queryId":"5c4edadbc741e78489cf3eb348507843","queryName":"IssueViewerViewQuery","variables":{"count":15,"id":"repository","number":9953,"owner":"MudBlazor","repo":"MudBlazor"},"result":{"data":{"repository":{"isOwnerEnterpriseManaged":false,"issue":{"id":"I_kwDOETEShM6ZurSy","updatedAt":"2025-07-30T14:27:14Z","title":" v8.0.0 Migration Guide ","number":9953,"repository":{"nameWithOwner":"MudBlazor/MudBlazor","id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyODg0Mjg2NzY=","name":"MudBlazor","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","login":"MudBlazor","id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc5NzU1MDY0","url":"https://github.com/MudBlazor","databaseId":79755064},"isArchived":false,"isPrivate":false,"databaseId":288428676,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"visibility":"PUBLIC","viewerCanPush":false,"viewerCanInteract":false,"viewerInteractionLimitReasonHTML":"","isCopilotAgentEnabled":null,"pinnedIssues":{"totalCount":2},"viewerCanPinIssues":false,"viewerIssueCreationPermissions":{"triageable":false},"issueTypes":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"IT_kwDOBMD3OM4A2bAO"}},{"node":{"id":"IT_kwDOBMD3OM4A2bAS"}},{"node":{"id":"IT_kwDOBMD3OM4A2bAU"}}]}},"titleHTML":" v8.0.0 Migration Guide ","url":"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9953","viewerCanUpdateNext":false,"issueType":null,"state":"OPEN","stateReason":null,"duplicateOf":null,"linkedPullRequests":{"nodes":[]},"subIssuesSummary":{"total":0,"completed":0},"__isLabelable":"Issue","labels":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMzQ5MjAzNTUz","color":"d93f0b","name":"breaking change","nameHTML":"breaking change","description":"This change will require consumer code updates","url":"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/labels/breaking%20change","__typename":"Label"},"cursor":"MQ"},{"node":{"id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjgzOTg0OTQ1","color":"006b75","name":"docs","nameHTML":"docs","description":"Web or code documentation or examples","url":"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/labels/docs","__typename":"Label"},"cursor":"Mg"}],"pageInfo":{"endCursor":"Mg","hasNextPage":false}},"__isNode":"Issue","assignedActors":{"nodes":[]},"milestone":null,"databaseId":2579150002,"viewerDidAuthor":false,"locked":false,"author":{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"ScarletKuro","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTUzMjI1","profileUrl":"https://github.com/ScarletKuro","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19953225?u=0b1139188a0e3e9fa36f76d7371e9290343a1c7e\u0026v=4"},"__isComment":"Issue","body":"Previous migration guide: [v7.0.0 Migration Guide](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/8447).\n\n## .NET 7 is no longer supported\nFor .NET 7 support, stay on the latest v7.x.x version. For bug fixes in v7, please PR and we'll release updates.\n\nMore details: [#9511](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9511)\n\n## Dialog\n\u003e [!CAUTION]\n\u003e Change `MudDialogInstance` to `IMudDialogInstance`.\n\n`DialogOptions` is now an immutable record. Use `SetOptionsAsync` and `with` to modify `DialogOptions`:\n\n```csharp\n[CascadingParameter]\nprivate IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; }\n\nprivate Task ToggleFullscreenAsync()\n{\n    var options = MudDialog.Options with\n    {\n        FullScreen = !(MudDialog.Options.FullScreen ?? false)\n    };\n\n    return MudDialog.SetOptionsAsync(options);\n}\n```\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10066\n\n## KeyInterceptor\n`IKeyInterceptor` / `KeyInterceptor`, `IKeyInterceptorFactory` / `KeyInterceptorFactory` were removed and replaced with `KeyInterceptorService`. More details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9896\n\n`KeyOptions` is now immutable. More details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9969\n\n## MudPopoverService\nRemoved from the core, replaced by `PopoverService`. The `MudPopoverService` was legacy, provided only for cases where you might encounter issues with `PopoverService`. If you encounter issues, please submit an issue.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9957\n\n## DialogService\n- Removed `OnDialogInstanceAdded`, use `DialogInstanceAddedAsync` instead. [#9980](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9980)\n\n## Converters\nIn **Converter.cs**, several property signatures have been updated to enhance localization support. These properties no longer return English messages directly. Instead, they now return keys intended for localization, accompanied by additional parameters:\n\n- **OnError**: Updated from `Action\u003cstring\u003e?` to `Action\u003cstring, object[]\u003e?`. This allows passing a key and optional parameters, enabling more flexible and accurate localization.\n- **SetErrorMessage** and **GetErrorMessage**: Both changed from `string?` to `(string, object[])?`. These properties now provide a key for localization along with relevant parameters, shifting message formatting to the localization system.\n\n## EventUtil\nThe following API has been removed:\n```csharp\nEventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\n```\nIt has been replaced with:\n```csharp\nthis.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\n```\nBecause this is now an extension method that requires a reference to `ComponentBase`. The previous `EventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler` did not propagate exceptions to `ErrorBoundary` (see https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/54543). The new method ensures that exceptions are properly handled and propagated.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9967\n\n## Charts\n- `TimeSeriesDiplayType` was renamed to `TimeSeriesDisplayType`.\n- `EndSlopeSpline`, `ILineInterpolator`, `Matrix`, `MatrixSolver`, `NaturalSpline`, `PeriodicSpline`, `SplineInterpolator`, `SvgCircle`, `SvgPath`, `SvgText` are now internal.\n- `TimeSeriesChartSeries`, `TimeSeriesDisplayType` moved to `MudBlazor` namespace for consistency.\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9919\n\n## DataGrid\n**CellActions**:\nThe following properties are now \"required\":\n- SetSelectedItemAsync\n- StartEditingItemAsync\n- CancelEditingItemAsync\n- ToggleHierarchyVisibilityForItemAsync\n\n**Column**:\n- Removed `Action ColumnStateHasChanged`\n\n**MudDataGrid**:\n- `_classname` renamed to `Classname`\n- `_style` renamed to `Stylename`\n- `_tableStyle` renamed to `TableStyle`\n- `_tableClass` renamed to `TableClass`\n- `_headClassname` renamed to `HeadClassname`\n- `_footClassname` renamed to `FootClassname`\n- `_headerFooterStyle` renamed to `HeaderFooterStyle`\n- Removed `CancelledEditingItem`, replace with `CanceledEditingItem`. [#9982](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9982)\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10149\n\n## MudTheme\n- `BaseTypography` is now an **abstract** class! If you used `new BaseTypography()` please replace it with corresponding implementation. [#9434](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434)\n- Class `Default` was renamed to `DefaultTypography` to a allow source generation STJ usage. [#9434](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434)\n- Class `H1` was renamed to `H1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H2` was renamed to `H2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H3` was renamed to `H3Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H4` was renamed to `H4Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H5` was renamed to `H5Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `H6` was renamed to `H6Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Subtitle1` was renamed to `Subtitle1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Subtitle2` was renamed to `Subtitle2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Body1` was renamed to `Body1Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Body2` was renamed to `Body2Typography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Input` and the property was removed, use subtitle1. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Class `Button` was renamed to `ButtonTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Caption` was renamed to `CaptionTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- Class `Overline` was renamed to `OverlineTypography`. [#9962](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962)\n- In `Typography` the `FontWeight` and `LineHeight` are now an `string` type instead of `int`. [#9011](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9011)\n\n## DropZone\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionOrignZoneIdentiifer`, replace with `GetTransactionOriginZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionOrignZoneIdentifier`, replace with `GetTransactionOriginZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `GetTransactionCurrentZoneIdentiifer`, replace with `GetTransactionCurrentZoneIdentifier`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n- **MudDropContainer**: Removed `IsOrign`, replace with `IsOrigin`. [#9981](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9981)\n\n## Inputs\n- `Typo.input` was removed. Use `Typo.subtitle1` instead. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Accordingly all `input` typo CSS was removed. Use `--mud-typography-subtitle1` instead. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- Note: This changes the order of the `Typo` enum to where it was before v7. [#10028](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10028)\n- `MudInputAdornment.Edge` was replaced with `MudInputAdornment.Placement`. [#10057](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10057)\n- Popover menus now originate from under the field by default. [#10071](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10071)\n\n## Autocomplete\n- No longer wraps around to the top item when using arrow keys in order to align with similar components. [#10161](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10161)\n- The public `ScrollToListItemAsync` method was removed. [#10161](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10161)\n- When `Immediate` is enabled, the value is now coerced immediately. [#10138](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10138)\n\n## MudColor\n- Renamed `HslChanged` to `HslEquals`, and the result is now not reverted. [#10355](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10355)\n- `Equals` now checks both `RGBA` and `HSL` values. Previously, it only checked `RGBA`. [#10355](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10355)\n\n## MudMenu\n- Menus can now be directly nested without additional setup. Nested menus inside another MudMenu will now be rendered as a MudMenuItem instead of MudButton. [#10452](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10452), [#10469](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10469)\n- The popover now originates from under the activator by default. [#10071](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10071)\n- `IconSize` was removed in order to align with Material Design. [#10478](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10478) [#10542](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10542)\n\n## MudChip\n\nThe MudChip now renders a semantic anchor tag in place if the div if an href is specified. It can now be a true anchor and so no longer acts like a button. The browser now handles the click (and Enter key) so OnClick is disabled and the close button is no longer shown (if applicable). This improves accessibility, including allowing the user to hover it to see the link it will direct them to, middle click to open in a new tab, or drag to another place.\n\n## Localization\nIn `DefaultLocalizationInterceptor` we removed:\n```C#\nLocalizedString TranslationFallback(string key)\n```\nuse instead:\n```C#\nLocalizedString TranslationWithFallback(string key, params object[] arguments)\n```\n\n**Note:** Legacy keys were removed:\n| Old Key                        | New Key                           |\n|--------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| MudDataGrid.=                  | MudDataGrid_EqualSign             |\n| MudDataGrid.!=                 | MudDataGrid_NotEqualSign          |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003e                  | MudDataGrid_GreaterThanSign       |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003e=                 | MudDataGrid_GreaterThanOrEqualSign|\n| MudDataGrid.\u003c                  | MudDataGrid_LessThanSign          |\n| MudDataGrid.\u003c=                 | MudDataGrid_LessThanOrEqualSign   |\n| MudDataGrid.RefreshData        | MudDataGrid_RefreshData           |\n| MudDataGrid.is not             | MudDataGrid_IsNot                 |\n| MudDataGrid.is not empty       | MudDataGrid_IsNotEmpty            |\n| MudDataGrid.Sort               | MudDataGrid_Sort                  |\n| MudDataGrid.Save               | MudDataGrid_Save                  |\n| MudDataGrid.True               | MudDataGrid_True                  |\n| MudDataGrid.False              | MudDataGrid_False                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Hide               | MudDataGrid_Hide                  |\n| MudDataGrid.HideAll            | MudDataGrid_HideAll               |\n| MudDataGrid.starts with        | MudDataGrid_StartsWith            |\n| MudDataGrid.equals             | MudDataGrid_Equals                |\n| MudDataGrid.not equals         | MudDataGrid_NotEquals             |\n| MudDataGrid.Unsort             | MudDataGrid_Unsort                |\n| MudDataGrid.Columns            | MudDataGrid_Columns               |\n| MudDataGrid.Loading            | MudDataGrid_Loading               |\n| MudDataGrid.MoveUp             | MudDataGrid_MoveUp                |\n| MudDataGrid.MoveDown           | MudDataGrid_MoveDown              |\n| MudDataGrid.is                 | MudDataGrid_Is                    |\n| MudDataGrid.is before          | MudDataGrid_IsBefore              |\n| MudDataGrid.is on or before    | MudDataGrid_IsOnOrBefore          |\n| MudDataGrid.is on or after     | MudDataGrid_IsOnOrAfter           |\n| MudDataGrid.Filter             | MudDataGrid_Filter                |\n| MudDataGrid.contains           | MudDataGrid_Contains              |\n| MudDataGrid.Value              | MudDataGrid_Value                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Group              | MudDataGrid_Group                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Apply              | MudDataGrid_Apply                 |\n| MudDataGrid.Clear              | MudDataGrid_Clear                 |\n| MudDataGrid.ShowAll            | MudDataGrid_ShowAll               |\n| MudDataGrid.Column             | MudDataGrid_Column                |\n| MudDataGrid.Cancel             | MudDataGrid_Cancel                |\n| MudDataGrid.FilterValue        | MudDataGrid_FilterValue           |\n| MudDataGrid.Operator           | MudDataGrid_Operator              |\n| MudDataGrid.is empty           | MudDataGrid_IsEmpty               |\n| MudDataGrid.is after           | MudDataGrid_IsAfter               |\n| MudDataGrid.Ungroup            | MudDataGrid_Ungroup               |\n| MudDataGrid.not contains       | MudDataGrid_NotContains           |\n| MudDataGrid.ends with          | MudDataGrid_EndsWith              |\n| MudDataGrid.CollapseAllGroups  | MudDataGrid_CollapseAllGroups     |\n| MudDataGrid.AddFilter          | MudDataGrid_AddFilter             |\n| MudDataGrid.ExpandAllGroups    | MudDataGrid_ExpandAllGroups       |\n\nMore details: https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10001\n\n## Other Changes\n- **MudTable**: `EditButtonContext` namespace changed from `MudBlazorFix` to `MudBlazor`. [#9952](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9952)\n- **MudCollapse**: Reworked to use a grid instead of JavaScript for height calculation. Animation is now a static **300 ms**. [#10056](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10056)\n- **MudSelectItem**: `Ripple`, `Href`, `ForceLoad`, and `OnClick` parameters removed. They were never implemented. [#10045](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10045)\n- **MudBaseSelectItem**: Removed base class. Copy-paste its code if you inherited this class. [#10045](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10045)\n- **MudFormComponent**: `Dispose(bool disposing)` replaced with `protected virtual ValueTask DisposeAsyncCore()`. This affects all components inheriting this base class. [#10037](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10037)\n- **ResizeObserver**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IResizeObserver` / `IResizeObserverFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10055](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10055)\n- **EventListener**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IEventListener` / `IEventListenerFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10051](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10051)\n- **JsApiService**: Now internal. Inject `IJsApiService` via DI to use its API. [#9994](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9994)\n- **JsEvent**: Now internal and doesn't implement `IDisposable`. Inject `IJsEvent` / `IJsEventFactory` via DI to use its API. [#9996](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9996) [#10061](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10061)\n- **ScrollListener**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollListener` / `IScrollListenerFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollSpy**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollSpy` / `IScrollSpyFactory` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollManager**: Now internal. Inject `IScrollManager` via DI to use its API. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollManagerException**: Removed, not used in the core. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- **ScrollOptions**: Removed, not used in the core. [#10048](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10048)\n- Renamed `IIJSRuntimeExtentions` to `IJSRuntimeExtensions`. [#9997](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9997)\n- Renamed `SortingAssistent` to `SortingAssistant`. [#9952](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9952)\n- Removed `EnableIllegalRazorParameterDetection` from `MudGlobal`. [#9580](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9580)\n- **MudCheckBox**: Renamed `HandleKeyDown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudNumericField**: Renamed `HandleKeydown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`, `HandleKeyUp` to `HandleKeyUpAsync`, `OnMouseWheel` to `OnMouseWheelAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudSwitch**: Renamed `HandleKeyDown` to `HandleKeyDownAsync`. [#9921](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9921)\n- **MudFileUpload**: Now generates a new `input` with every file change to retain references to previous files. It is no longer possible to supply your own `id` to the underlying `input`. More details: [#9600](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9600)\n- **MudRadio**, **MudCheckBox**, **MudSwitch**: `LabelPosition` and `Placement` replaced by `LabelPlacement` of type `Placement` (enum). `Checked` property replaced by `T Value`. [#9472](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9472)\n- **MudSwitch**: `SwitchLabelClassname` was renamed to `LabelClassName`. [#9472](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9472)\n- **MudDrawer**: The variant `Temporary` / `Persistent` has been changed to behave non-responsively, meaning solely controlled by the `Open` parameter. [#10095](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10095)\n- **MudBreadcrumbs**: BreadcrumbItem is now a record and any class that inherits from it must be updated to a record as well. [#10116](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10116)\n- **MudBreadcrumbs**: The `ul` element is now an `ol` wrapped in a `nav` in order to improve accessibility semantics. [#10115](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10115)\n- **MudToggleItem**: The span containing the checkmark icon was removed and the icon is now a direct child of mud-button-label. Checkmark classes that were on the span have been moved to the icon as well.\n- **MudSelect**: The dropdown is now opened on `pointerdown` instead of `click` to match the behavior of similar components. [#10129](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10129)\n- **MudListItem**: Parameter `Gutters` was made nullable. [#10199](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10199)\n- **MudNumericField**: Changed default `InputMode` to `InputMode.decimal`. [#9923](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9923)\n- **MudPopover**: `RelativeWidth` is now nullable `bool?`. [#10238](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10238)\n- **MudSwipeArea**: Now uses `onpointer*` instead of `ontouch*`. Now supports swipes with mouse as well. [#9445](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9445)\n- **SnackbarOptions**: The delegate invoked on Snackbar click has been renamed from `Onclick` to `OnClick`. [#8589](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/8589)\n- **MudSelect**: Changed the visibility of `_currentIcon` from public to internal. [#10451](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10451)\n- **MudOverlay**: Moved to SectionOutlet with `MudPopoverProvider` in all cases except dialogs, absolute positioned overlays, and overlays with child content. Should have minimal impact unless you have previously used a workaround for overlay positioning. Unit tests now always need a popover provider if they want to interact/check if the mud-overlay exists, \ni.e. `var providerComp = Context.RenderComponent\u003cMudPopoverProvider\u003e();` [#10446](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10446)\n- **MudOverlay**: Now positioned statically and re positioned for nested popovers. to avoid this behavior set `Absolute=\"true\"`. [#10446](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10446)\n- **MudToggleGroup**: Removed `Rounded` in favor of our CSS utility classes, i.e. `rounded-pill`. [#10533](https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10533)","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003ePrevious migration guide: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/8447\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/8447/hovercard\"\u003ev7.0.0 Migration Guide\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003e.NET 7 is no longer supported\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eFor .NET 7 support, stay on the latest v7.x.x version. For bug fixes in v7, please PR and we'll release updates.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9511\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9511/hovercard\"\u003e#9511\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eDialog\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-caution\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cp class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"octicon octicon-stop mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"M4.47.22A.749.749 0 0 1 5 0h6c.199 0 .389.079.53.22l4.25 4.25c.141.14.22.331.22.53v6a.749.749 0 0 1-.22.53l-4.25 4.25A.749.749 0 0 1 11 16H5a.749.749 0 0 1-.53-.22L.22 11.53A.749.749 0 0 1 0 11V5c0-.199.079-.389.22-.53Zm.84 1.28L1.5 5.31v5.38l3.81 3.81h5.38l3.81-3.81V5.31L10.69 1.5ZM8 4a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-3.5A.75.75 0 0 1 8 4Zm0 8a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003eCaution\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eChange \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eMudDialogInstance\u003c/code\u003e to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eIMudDialogInstance\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eDialogOptions\u003c/code\u003e is now an immutable record. Use \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eSetOptionsAsync\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ewith\u003c/code\u003e to modify \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eDialogOptions\u003c/code\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"[CascadingParameter]\nprivate IMudDialogInstance MudDialog { get; set; }\n\nprivate Task ToggleFullscreenAsync()\n{\n    var options = MudDialog.Options with\n    {\n        FullScreen = !(MudDialog.Options.FullScreen ?? false)\n    };\n\n    return MudDialog.SetOptionsAsync(options);\n}\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003eCascadingParameter\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eprivate\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eIMudDialogInstance\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eMudDialog\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eget\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eset\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eprivate\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-smi\"\u003eTask\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-en\"\u003eToggleFullscreenAsync\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003evar\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eoptions\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eMudDialog\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eOptions\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003ewith\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\n        \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eFullScreen\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eMudDialog\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eOptions\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eFullScreen\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e??\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003efalse\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e\n\n    \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eMudDialog\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-en\"\u003eSetOptionsAsync\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eoptions\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2602181268\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/10066\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10066/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10066\"\u003e#10066\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eKeyInterceptor\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eIKeyInterceptor\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eKeyInterceptor\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eIKeyInterceptorFactory\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eKeyInterceptorFactory\u003c/code\u003e were removed and replaced with \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eKeyInterceptorService\u003c/code\u003e. More details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2563688231\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9896\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9896/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9896\"\u003e#9896\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eKeyOptions\u003c/code\u003e is now immutable. More details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2581640418\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9969\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9969/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9969\"\u003e#9969\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eMudPopoverService\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eRemoved from the core, replaced by \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ePopoverService\u003c/code\u003e. The \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eMudPopoverService\u003c/code\u003e was legacy, provided only for cases where you might encounter issues with \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ePopoverService\u003c/code\u003e. If you encounter issues, please submit an issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2579318207\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9957\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9957/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9957\"\u003e#9957\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eDialogService\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemoved \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eOnDialogInstanceAdded\u003c/code\u003e, use \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eDialogInstanceAddedAsync\u003c/code\u003e instead. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9980\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9980/hovercard\"\u003e#9980\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eConverters\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIn \u003cstrong\u003eConverter.cs\u003c/strong\u003e, several property signatures have been updated to enhance localization support. These properties no longer return English messages directly. Instead, they now return keys intended for localization, accompanied by additional parameters:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnError\u003c/strong\u003e: Updated from \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eAction\u0026lt;string\u0026gt;?\u003c/code\u003e to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eAction\u0026lt;string, object[]\u0026gt;?\u003c/code\u003e. This allows passing a key and optional parameters, enabling more flexible and accurate localization.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSetErrorMessage\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eGetErrorMessage\u003c/strong\u003e: Both changed from \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003estring?\u003c/code\u003e to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e(string, object[])?\u003c/code\u003e. These properties now provide a key for localization along with relevant parameters, shifting message formatting to the localization system.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eEventUtil\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe following API has been removed:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"EventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eEventUtil\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eAsNonRenderingEventHandler\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e..\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIt has been replaced with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"this.AsNonRenderingEventHandler(...)\"\u003e\u003cpre class=\"notranslate\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003ethis\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s1\"\u003eAsNonRenderingEventHandler\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e..\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-kos\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eBecause this is now an extension method that requires a reference to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eComponentBase\u003c/code\u003e. The previous \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eEventUtil.AsNonRenderingEventHandler\u003c/code\u003e did not propagate exceptions to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eErrorBoundary\u003c/code\u003e (see \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2186873992\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/54543\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/54543/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/54543\"\u003edotnet/aspnetcore#54543\u003c/a\u003e). The new method ensures that exceptions are properly handled and propagated.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2581328434\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9967\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9967/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9967\"\u003e#9967\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eCharts\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTimeSeriesDiplayType\u003c/code\u003e was renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTimeSeriesDisplayType\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eEndSlopeSpline\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eILineInterpolator\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eMatrix\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eMatrixSolver\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eNaturalSpline\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003ePeriodicSpline\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eSplineInterpolator\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eSvgCircle\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eSvgPath\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eSvgText\u003c/code\u003e are now internal.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTimeSeriesChartSeries\u003c/code\u003e, \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTimeSeriesDisplayType\u003c/code\u003e moved to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eMudBlazor\u003c/code\u003e namespace for consistency.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2568723826\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/9919\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9919/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9919\"\u003e#9919\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eDataGrid\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCellActions\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003cbr\u003e\nThe following properties are now \"required\":\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSetSelectedItemAsync\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStartEditingItemAsync\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCancelEditingItemAsync\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eToggleHierarchyVisibilityForItemAsync\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColumn\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemoved \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eAction ColumnStateHasChanged\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMudDataGrid\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_classname\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eClassname\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_style\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eStylename\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_tableStyle\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTableStyle\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_tableClass\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eTableClass\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_headClassname\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eHeadClassname\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_footClassname\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eFootClassname\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e_headerFooterStyle\u003c/code\u003e renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eHeaderFooterStyle\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRemoved \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eCancelledEditingItem\u003c/code\u003e, replace with \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eCanceledEditingItem\u003c/code\u003e. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9982\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9982/hovercard\"\u003e#9982\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eMore details: \u003ca class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2626804566\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/issues/10149\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10149/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/10149\"\u003e#10149\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 dir=\"auto\"\u003eMudTheme\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eBaseTypography\u003c/code\u003e is now an \u003cstrong\u003eabstract\u003c/strong\u003e class! If you used \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003enew BaseTypography()\u003c/code\u003e please replace it with corresponding implementation. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434/hovercard\"\u003e#9434\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClass \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eDefault\u003c/code\u003e was renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eDefaultTypography\u003c/code\u003e to a allow source generation STJ usage. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9434/hovercard\"\u003e#9434\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClass \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH1\u003c/code\u003e was renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH1Typography\u003c/code\u003e. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962/hovercard\"\u003e#9962\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClass \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH2\u003c/code\u003e was renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH2Typography\u003c/code\u003e. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962/hovercard\"\u003e#9962\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClass \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH3\u003c/code\u003e was renamed to \u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003eH3Typography\u003c/code\u003e. \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/MudBlazor/MudBlazor/pull/9962/hovercard\"\u003e#9